# button: bar area, modifiers+button, action, argument
button ltsymbol left setlayout "[ ]"
button title middle zoom
button title left notifyopen
button title right notifydismiss
button wintitle wheel-up focusstack -1
button wintitle wheel-down focusstack 1
button status middle spawn foot
button tray left trayactivate
button tray right traymenu
button tagbar left view 0
button tagbar right toggleview 0
button tagbar logo+left tag 0
button tagbar logo+right toggletag 0
button tagbar wheel-up shiftview -1
button tagbar wheel-down shiftview 1
button client logo+left moveresize move
button client logo+middle togglefloating
button client logo+right moveresize resize
